# Working notes, research, and agent instructions. Local only — never published.
docs/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
notes/
scratch/
*.private.md

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment — model API keys live here, never committed
.env
.env.local

# The unpacked tarball cache. Disposable, and since 0.5.0 it is written outside
# the project entirely; this only covers older checkouts that still have one.
.stantal/npm/

# pacote's own HTTP cache. Thousands of files, entirely reconstructible.
.stantal/http-cache/

# Behaviour cassettes: 14MB and growing. Committing them would let anyone
# reproduce a Layer 2 run offline, which is what --replay is for, but the size
# is a real repo-weight decision and it is not one to make silently.
.stantal/behaviour/

# Judge cassettes and seed corpora ARE committed, on purpose. action.yml tells
# users the recordings are "committed to the repository", and the 168-finding
# headline replays from these with an invalid key — a claim nobody can check if
# the evidence is only ever on one laptop. They are public package text and
# model answers; no keys, nothing private.

